    "basic_qualifications": "- Bachelor's degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems, Mathematics, or a related field<br/>- 3+ years of data engineering experience<br/>- 3+ years of developing and operating large-scale data structures for business intelligence analytics using ETL/ELT processes experience<br/>- Experience in scripting for automation (e.g. Python) and advanced SQL skills.<br/>- Experience in building analytic or scientific data products or solutions<br/>- Experience building data pipelines or automated ETL processes<br/>- Knowledge of distributed systems as it pertains to data storage and computing<br/>- Experience working with data warehousing, data quality",
